    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαθάπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fasten</i> or <i>put on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἀγκίστρῳ ἰχθῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			 :— 
				Med.
			, <i>fasten on oneself, put on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεβρίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.364e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαταστρέφω, ἀγγεῖον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.6
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμβικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.95
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύβλιον τῷ ἀλγοῦντι μέρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					2.45
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>enclose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυξίδα πυξίδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Callisth.
					3.31
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> intr. c. dat.,
				<i>grasp, enclose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνες οἷον χειρῶν ἐπαφαῖς π. τοῖς
					ἐκτὸς σώμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					4.13.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Phil.Hist.</u>
				94
			</span></i>.</div>
